Z||000004||Songman||05-24-2001||09:29 AM||||Unless you count when he was assimilated.. Locutus was pretty scary! Of course, he was crazy in Moby Dick.. I've seen him do Shakespeare, which was not much of a stretch for him but I saw him in a movie as a cowboy one time. Not sure of the movie because it has been a while, but I think he had hair too!<P>You know, I had Conspiracy Theory on video for a long time and never even watched it. Finally got it out and watched it and have seen in about 3 times in the last couple of months. I thought it was a great movie, although different for Mel Gibson.<P>And yes, I do think that a lot of that stuff is real. And I do think there are people that live just like him. It can get pretty scary if you think about it, can't it...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
